    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im having some really bad pain in my side on the right, kinda goes down towards my groin. its pretty intense. i had kidney stones last year so i think its probably just that happening again but i also noticed my stomach feels like it's pulsing a bit when i lie down. is that normal with stones or should i be worried?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
