      "content": "a gallon of water? that seems like a lot. i'm just worried about the pulsing though. it's kinda rhythmic, like a heartbeat in my belly. you're sure that's just the stones moving? i'm also on some blood pressure meds, can i take the ibuprofen with those or is that gonna mess things up?",
